/* AgentKit UI strings (en)
 *
 * Keys are dotted and grouped by area: pane.* button.* mcp.* skill.* session.*
 * Both tables must carry exactly the same key set — Tests/main.swift asserts it.
 * Filled in by task-3.
 *
 * Interface English, not a literal translation of the Chinese: buttons are
 * imperatives ("Reload", not "Reload data"), empty states say what to do next,
 * and product terms (MCP, skills, sessions, provider, descriptor) are left
 * untranslated. Keys that name identifiers a user must type — id / name /
 * apiKey / tools / models — stay as the real key names in both languages.
 */

